{"route":"SUPPORTED","coverage":"PARTIAL","answer":[{"text":"In the System menu's Language option, the manual lists these options: English, Italian, Portuguese and Spanish.","evidence_ids":["evidence_c05b0c728fd120d8d9f9f4ad","evidence_c6c47cb26648960a02d4b727","evidence_de4c690b1c25827ccfdc72d1","evidence_90061300e4df669ac99f9d8d","evidence_7f57d765db8c41979f270112"]},{"text":"The list continues with German and French.","evidence_ids":["evidence_a5e8430eda5a282f5c17e986","evidence_0dff6026a67902df25210af2"]},{"text":"Center press the joystick with the language option selected to explore the options.","evidence_ids":["evidence_43f253bf1b19cfad0863d4cd"]},{"text":"Navigate the options with joystick up and down press and select with joystick center press.","evidence_ids":["evidence_045010b903a440ff9710ad58"]},{"text":"Press the home button on the LH switch cube to go back.","evidence_ids":["evidence_832663de88f40835d6f7105e"]}],"policy":[],"watchouts":[],"disclaimers":[{"text":"The six languages above are the ones I could confirm from the admitted manual text; other source passages were retrieved but could not be used, so I cannot confirm that this is the complete list."}],"watchout_review":[{"display_id":"evidence_081f245f33f1dec5cb06a080","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"Electrical specs warning about unapproved modifications; unrelated to display languages."},{"display_id":"evidence_13dac6aaee2fcbdd57618d29","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB charger caution; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_31f9ffe7f325a580f7c58947","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB charger rain warning; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_87d7aaf9a6f68c203a240607","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB port warning; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_a35159dd2d88b584ad319de1","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB cable caution; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_a4a384cb8cd1cd437ac00907","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB cable insertion warning; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_b345d26bcf46960f7125d8d8","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB port cap caution; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_da497f5f0bbf1c24b8f93714","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"Bulb/electrical rating warning; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_ea69e5fbd3ff27f1dd159960","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB current caution; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_f4f3ea7f748d6732d21cae42","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB port cap warning; unrelated."},{"display_id":"evidence_f5f14378db31693f76bd2a81","decision":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"USB charging device warning; unrelated."}],"clarification_question":""}
